<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE</view
  ><view class="title">我的与设置</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view
  ><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice success">{{notice}}</view
  ><view class="panel"
    ><view class="section-title">AI 服务</view
    ><view class="muted"
      >资料和用于比较的笔记会发送给所选提供方。密钥在服务端加密保存。</view
    ><view class="label">OpenAI 兼容接口地址</view
    ><input data-field="endpoint" value="{{endpoint}}" bindinput="input" /><view
      class="label"
      >模型名称</view
    ><input
      data-field="model"
      value="{{model}}"
      bindinput="input"
      placeholder="提供方实际模型标识"
    /><view class="label">API Key</view
    ><input
      password
      data-field="key"
      value="{{key}}"
      bindinput="input"
      placeholder="{{settings.ai.hasKey?'已保存，留空复用':'在此填写密钥'}}"
    /><button
      class="primary"
      bindtap="save"
      loading="{{busy}}"
      disabled="{{busy || !model}}"
    >
      保存并校验</button
    ><view class="small">校验会发送一次模型请求，可能产生费用。</view></view
  ><view class="panel"
    ><view class="section-title">同步状态</view
    ><view class="notice"
      >云端保存不依赖电脑在线。请在桌面端绑定本机 Obsidian 目录。</view
    ><view wx:for="{{settings.devices}}" wx:key="id"
      ><view class="card-title">{{item.name}}</view
      ><view class="meta">最近连接：{{item.updated_at}}</view
      ><view class="small"
        >{{item.status.summary}} {{item.status.error}}</view
      ></view
    ></view
  ><button class="secondary" bindtap="sources">来源与插件</button
  ><view wx:if="{{sources}}" class="panel"
    ><view class="card-title">公开网页、PDF、文字、图片</view
    ><view class="meta">已实现读取；实际读取范围随资料保存。</view
    ><view class="section-title">Fenext插件 · Chrome / Edge</view
    ><view class="meta"
      >在电脑浏览器安装 Fenext插件，连接后提取当前页面并保存到同一知识空间。</view
    ></view
  ><view class="notice"
    >当前为个人测试账号，微信和手机号绑定尚未接入。资料、聊天、建议与历史默认保留；备份按服务端说明执行。</view
  ><button class="secondary" bindtap="logout">退出登录</button></view
>
